{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"43a8b8fef39fbcebe78a7f7681e049fdc3c3d62ae2bf4cfae5b743187377a2fd","digest":{"component_or_area":"library warning subsystem","key_entities":["src/rebar/_lib_warn.py","CrossSessionWarning","emit_cross_session_warning","suppress_cross_session_warning","cross_session_warning_for","_EMITTING","contextvars.ContextVar","src/rebar/__init__.py","src/rebar/_lib_reads.py","src/rebar/_lib_writes.py","src/rebar/_lib_mutations.py","src/rebar/_lib_gates.py","src/rebar/_cli/_execute.py","src/rebar/mcp_server.py","show_ticket","deps","transition","comment","edit_ticket","link","unlink","tag","untag","archive","set_file_impact","declare_no_file_impact","clarity_check","check_ac"],"problem_keywords":["cross-session warning","library surface","warnings subsystem","re-entrancy guard","single-emit dedup"],"propositions":["Library single-ticket functions must emit a deduplicated warnings.warn of category CrossSessionWarning when the detector fires for a cross-session holder, before returning.","The warning emission must be re-entrancy-guarded via a contextvars.ContextVar so the detector's internal show_ticket call does not recurse and exactly one warning fires per top-level call.","The emission must be best-effort, wrapped in try/except Exception: pass, so the library operation always proceeds regardless of detector or warning failures.","CLI and MCP surfaces must suppress the library CrossSessionWarning to avoid doubling their own advisories (CLI WARN line, MCP response field).","Bulk read operations and claim must not emit warnings; write operations emit before mutation to read the holder pre-change; link/unlink emit only for primary endpoint id1."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.an